WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
1. Click the magnifying glass to open Find in Files.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
2. Type Trail Notes to find the matching lines.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
3. To change the text, choose Find > Replace in Files.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
4. Enter the new name: Weekend Notes.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.500
5. Click Replace... to review the changes.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.500
6. Keep checked only the changes you want.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.000
7. Click Replace in the review to apply them.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
8. Choose File > Save All.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.000
9. Click the magnifying glass. Search again: No results.

